      "description": "White service links and a direct yellow call action on the brand-blue header.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><a href=\"/services/\">Services</a><a href=\"/prices/\">Prices</a><a href=\"/contact/\">Contact</a><a class=\"ds-nav-call\" href=\"tel:+12154940300\">Call now</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{min-height:94px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;padding:18px 24px;background:#174ecd;font-family:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif}.ds-nav>a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:5px;color:#fff;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:background 180ms cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}.ds-nav>a:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.13)}.ds-nav>a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #fefe00;outline-offset:4px}.ds-nav>.ds-nav-call{min-height:48px;margin-left:16px;padding:14px 19px;background:#fefe00;color:#111827;font-weight:700}.ds-nav>.ds-nav-call:hover{background:#e5e500}"
